 I opened SEV2 incident INC-0001, which paged on-call.\n\n1. **Rollback:** v2.3.1 was failing health checks in us-east, us-west and eu-west, with an error rate of about 18%. I rolled it back to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. I skipped v2.3.1-rc because it had only been healthy in staging, never in production.\n2. **Check after rollback:** all three regions now run v2.3.0, the service reports healthy, and the error rate is down to about 0.2%.\n3. **Incident:** INC-0001 is open and describes the failure, the rollback and the recovery. It also says the cause of the v2.3.1 failure needs to be found before it's redeployed.", "type": "text"}]}]}